uot;,monospace,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.1;color:rgb(248,248,242);background-color:rgb(39,40,34);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(174,129,255)\">4 : </span>In summary.cross(cross) :<span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;color:rgb(174,129,255)\"> Strange genotype pattern on chr 24.</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.1;color:rgb(248,248,242);background-color:rgb(39,40,34);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.1;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.1;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\">So I am guessing that the warning about the length of arg alleles is because the data is loaded as a f2 cross. But how to specify 4-way cross?</font></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.1;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.1\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">I will send you my data in a separate email, in case you </span><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">might</span><span style=\"font-s